  "authorityRules": [
    "Edit operational SOP, package, live-order and approval masters in Google Drive.",
    "Edit canonical structured recipe data in the GitHub working copy and regenerate its runtime representations.",
    "Publish read-optimised source releases into the ChatGPT Riviera Project for daily kitchen use.",
    "A conversation correction is a proposed change until the affected master is updated and the relevant release is republished and verified.",
    "Never merge independently edited copies by timestamp or newest-file-wins."
